{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates Java code to GNU C++11 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following Java 8 code to GNU C++11 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original Java 8 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\nimport java.io.*;\nimport java.util.*;\n\npublic class EdE_Variant5 {\n\n    private static final int MOD = 998244353;\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws Exception {\n        BufferedReader br = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n        String[] tokens = br.readLine().split(\"\\\\s+\");\n        long n = Long.parseLong(tokens[0]);\n        long k = Long.parseLong(tokens[1]);\n\n        long[] fact = new long[200001];\n        fact[0] = 1;\n        for (int i = 1; i <= 200000; i++) {\n            fact[i] = (fact[i - 1] * i) % MOD;\n        }\n\n        if (k >= n) {\n            System.out.println(0);\n            return;\n        }\n\n        int diff = (int)(n - k);\n        long total = 0;\n        for (int i = 0; i < diff; i++) {\n            long numerator = fact[diff];\n            long denominator = (fact[i] * fact[diff - i]) % MOD;\n            long binom = numerator * modPow(denominator, MOD - 2, MOD) % MOD;\n\n            long powerVal = modPow(diff - i, n, MOD);\n            long contribution = binom * powerVal % MOD;\n\n            if (i % 2 == 0) {\n                total = (total + contribution) % MOD;\n            } else {\n                total = (total - contribution + MOD) % MOD;\n            }\n        }\n\n        if (k != 0) {\n            total = (total * 2) % MOD;\n        }\n\n        total = total * fact[(int)n] % MOD;\n        total = total * modInverse(fact[(int)k], MOD) % MOD;\n        total = total * modInverse(fact[diff], MOD) % MOD;\n\n        System.out.println(total);\n    }\n\n    private static long modPow(long base, long exp, long mod) {\n        long result = 1;\n        base %= mod;\n        while (exp > 0) {\n            if ((exp & 1) == 1) {\n                result = (result * base) % mod;\n            }\n            base = (base * base) % mod;\n            exp >>= 1;\n        }\n        return result;\n    }\n\n    private static long modInverse(long a, long mod) {\n        return modPow(a, mod - 2, mod);\n    }\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "qwen/qwen3-coder-next"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\n#include <iostream>\n#include <string>\n#include <vector>\n#include <sstream>\nusing namespace std;\n\nconst long long MOD = 998244353;\n\nlong long modPow(long long base, long long exp, long long mod) {\n    long long result = 1;\n    base %= mod;\n    while (exp > 0) {\n        if ((exp & 1) == 1) {\n            result = (result * base) % mod;\n        }\n        base = (base * base) % mod;\n        exp >>= 1;\n    }\n    return result;\n}\n\nlong long modInverse(long long a, long long mod) {\n    return modPow(a, mod - 2, mod);\n}\n\nint main() {\n    string line;\n    getline(cin, line);\n    stringstream ss(line);\n    vector<string> tokens;\n    string token;\n    while (ss >> token) {\n        tokens.push_back(token);\n    }\n    \n    long long n = stoll(tokens[0]);\n    long long k = stoll(tokens[1]);\n\n    vector<long long> fact(200001);\n    fact[0] = 1;\n    for (int i = 1; i <= 200000; i++) {\n        fact[i] = (fact[i - 1] * i) % MOD;\n    }\n\n    if (k >= n) {\n        cout << 0 << endl;\n        return 0;\n    }\n\n    int diff = (int)(n - k);\n    long long total = 0;\n    for (int i = 0; i < diff; i++) {\n        long long numerator = fact[diff];\n        long long denominator = (fact[i] * fact[diff - i]) % MOD;\n        long long binom = numerator * modPow(denominator, MOD - 2, MOD) % MOD;\n\n        long long powerVal = modPow(diff - i, n, MOD);\n        long long contribution = binom * powerVal % MOD;\n\n        if (i % 2 == 0) {\n            total = (total + contribution) % MOD;\n        } else {\n            total = (total - contribution + MOD) % MOD;\n        }\n    }\n\n    if (k != 0) {\n        total = (total * 2) % MOD;\n    }\n\n    total = total * fact[(int)n] % MOD;\n    total = total * modInverse(fact[(int)k], MOD) % MOD;\n    total = total * modInverse(fact[diff], MOD) % MOD;\n\n    cout << total << endl;\n    return 0;\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-9.083335316972807e-05, -2.145764938177308e-06, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -0.00025733973598107696, -5.960462772236497e-07, -2.861018856492592e-06, -3.2186455882765586e-06, -3.6954811548639555e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.5512948632240295, -0.00029738296871073544, -2.9802276912960224e-06, -1.2397689715726301e-05, -0.20216166973114014, -0.0003805628512054682, -0.00020394629973452538, -1.5497195136049413e-06, -0.09557188302278519, -0.05488365888595581, -0.5231873989105225, -8.34461570775602e-06, -1.9073468138230965e-06, -4.768370445162873e-07, -0.001335682114586234, -0.2519489526748657, -6.711257447022945e-05, -3.4570634852570947e-06, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, -9.536738616588991e-07, 0.0, -4.768370445162873e-07, -2.0265558760002023e-06, -4.0531076592742465e-06, -5.960462772236497e-07, -2.145764938177308e-06, -4.2914423829643056e-05, -5.566918844124302e-05, -3.814689989667386e-06, -5.8412379075889476e-06, -2.3603161025675945e-05, -3.0159495508996